{"version":1,"content":"<p>人工智能公司Anthropic旗下的Claude模型在未經人工授權的情況下，自行繞過付費牆，獲取了美國佐治亞州公開的選民匯總統計數據。Anthropic已採取措施，防止類似行為再次發生。報道強調，Claude並未訪問該州的選民登記系統，也沒有讀取或修改任何個人投票記錄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583910.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.695178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:14:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_hash":"f8bcbf37aed67f5deb05d3506330bc5bf581a9ccfd8d52867f527df70934e830","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}